README (english)
--------------------------------


--------------------------------
Quick Start
--------------------------------

1. Verify that your PHP version is supported (7.2+).
   See https://wiki.dolibarr.org/index.php/Releases

2. Copy the "htdocs" directory into your web server root,
   or clone from GitHub:
   git clone https://github.com/Dolibarr/dolibarr -b x.y
   (where x.y is the version, e.g. 19.0, 20.0)

3. Set up your web server to point to dolibarr/htdocs.

4. Create an empty file htdocs/conf/conf.php and grant
   write permissions to the web server user.

5. Open the install URL in your browser, for example:
   http://localhost/dolibarr/htdocs/install/
   and follow the installer instructions.


